From cb3784d2a3c6606ec144858b2a9fbd514f0aa04f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rosetta <its-rosetta@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:03:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] Recover interrupted multiplayer identity staging

- Reconcile persistent actor and collaborator staging with current canonical profile tables before replaying the identity migration.\n- Persist sparse attribution staging so a killed process can resume without losing durable authorship snapshots.\n- Apply the frozen identity migration explicitly when later ledger rows would make Drizzle skip its timestamp.\n- Prove the production-shaped interrupted state fails before this change and preserves both profile sets after recovery.
---
 packages/db/src/migrate.ts       | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 packages/db/test/migrate.test.ts |  89 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 213 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/db/src/migrate.ts b/packages/db/src/migrate.ts
